    "test_vector_segments.py": "Bounded segment work, unchanged reuse, tombstones, compaction, schema3 migration, Unicode, failed atomic publication, immutable old mappings, query snapshot/GC race and per-source/extension exact scoring.",
    "test_retrieval_v03.py": "Structural headings/sentences, exact source spans and line locations, parser/page boundaries, input bounds, old-cache short-path migration, update/delete postings, FTS-first query plan, literal escaped paths and filtered Engine dispatch.",
    "test_embedding_queue.py": "Duplicate hashes, semantic revocation/reactivation, existing-vector reuse, model replacement/update/delete, transaction rollback, one-time legacy migration, no full scan on restart, indexed reference lookups and bounded idle queue operations."
