  "limitations": [
    "These small file-level recall samples do not establish general retrieval accuracy or answer correctness.",
    "The single cross-language query misses top 5 in every measured run; it also misses top 10 in the expanded corpus.",
    "Filtered semantic scoring uses bounded batches but visits every matching published vector; latency grows with the filtered vector count.",
    "Structural locators identify extracted blocks, pages, rows or cells. Character offsets explicitly indicate extraction_chunk or grouped_extraction and source_spans; they are not original-file byte offsets.",
    "Existing cached chunks are preserved until their document is reparsed; this report uses fresh isolated indexes.",
    "No claims about 8GB/16GB machines, hundred-GB user corpora, Linux hardware or multi-node performance follow from these results."
  ],
